---
title: Borscht
description: A hearty beet and beef soup
servings: 8
cook time: 2 hours
prep time: 30 minutes
cuisine: Russian
---

In a #large pot{} combine
@cold water{8%c},
@canned tomatoes{1.5%c},
@?onion{1}(chopped or minced),
@green pepper{1/2}(chopped or minced),
@raw beets{2%c}(grated, or substitute canned shoestring beets),
@cabbage{3%c}(shredded),
@stew beef{3%lbs}(cut into bite-sized pieces),
@salt{1.5%tbs}(yes, really that much),
and
@black pepper{1/4%tsp}.

Simmer for at least ~{2%hours} until the meat is very tender. Stir
occasionally. Avoid boiling for more than a few seconds!

Serve hot with @sour cream{} on the side and optionally garnish with
@?dill{}. Consider serving @./pirozhki{3} on the side.
